# Enterprise CHANAKYA Loading Experience (CO-UX-008)

Status: **ENTERPRISE APPROVED · FROZEN**  
Priority: **CRITICAL** · Scope: entire Catalyst One platform

## Constitution

> Users should never wait without receiving value.

Every loading state must Inform · Guide · Educate · Reassure · Increase business awareness.

A meaningless spinner must never be shown when a contextual CHANAKYA experience can be displayed.

## Canonical framework

| Concern | Path |
|--------|------|
| UI | `src/components/catalyst-one/chanakya-loading/` |
| Controlled gate | `EnterpriseLoadingSurface` |
| Session / levels | `src/lib/chanakya-loading/use-chanakya-loading-session.ts` |
| Message compose | `src/lib/chanakya-loading/compose-messages.ts` |
| Live signals (EBI) | `src/lib/chanakya-loading/derive-live-signals.ts` |
| Catalogs | `src/constants/chanakya-loading/` |
| Types | `src/types/chanakya-loading.ts` |

## Loading levels

1. **&lt; 500ms** — no loading UI  
2. **500ms–2s** — CHANAKYA + preparing line  
3. **&gt; 2s** — rotate prioritised messages every 2.5s (fade only)

Never artificially delay when work is ready.

## Priority order

Critical → Pending work → Business insights → Progress → Tips → Knowledge  

Never show educational tips while critical / pending work exists.

## Data

Live insights consume **EBI compose** (and optional caller-supplied signals from EME / ETE / Deal Registry). Do not invent parallel KPI formulas.

## Forbidden

- Page-specific spinner frameworks  
- Second loading experience libraries  
- Hardcoded demo business numbers in loading copy (use live signals or static educational text only)
